input arrays reversed: sec 7.4/12.6: the new ledger's succession is anchored in the cut's second alone; that record is an old record, so in the new segment the root has no retirement, its history after handing off is a ledger entry with a hard AUTHORITY_MISMATCH, and the old segment lists the succession MALFORMED and MISSING. Read over the whole anchor set the history would be RETIRED instead.
